WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,110 --> 00:00:03,110
It's because this sword is about to be demolished.

2
00:00:03,110 --> 00:00:05,400
The reason why he scares passers-by

3
00:00:05,400 --> 00:00:07,460
I just want them to help him find shoes.

4
00:00:07,460 --> 00:00:09,460
So what should we do now?

5
00:00:09,460 --> 00:00:12,460
Do you want to use a floating spell to suppress it and then transcend? Fart?

6
00:00:12,460 --> 00:00:14,460
People are already miserable enough and you still take advantage of them

7
00:00:14,460 --> 00:00:16,460
Do you, the 749 Bureau, understand what customer care is?

8
00:00:16,460 --> 00:00:17,460
give me a day

9
00:00:17,460 --> 00:00:19,460
Just help him find the other embroidered shoe that was lost 30 years ago

10
00:00:19,460 --> 00:00:20,460
Let him make a pair

11
00:00:20,460 --> 00:00:22,460
As soon as his obsession disappears, he will leave on his own

12
00:00:22,460 --> 00:00:23,460
No need for animals, no need to waste a soul bomb

13
00:00:23,460 --> 00:00:25,460
Not to mention wasting my expensive frame materials

14
00:00:25,460 --> 00:00:28,460
But if we go to help him find shoes, it will cost us at most some gas and mineral water money.

15
00:00:28,460 --> 00:00:29,460
No more than 50 yuan is needed to survive

16
00:00:29,460 --> 00:00:33,010
Let's all retreat and give him a day.

17
00:00:33,010 --> 00:00:43,720
Vigo, this is too outrageous, right?

18
00:00:43,720 --> 00:00:46,780
Use the bureau's most comprehensive sky-eye system and large-scale population multiplier

19
00:00:46,780 --> 00:00:49,780
Go check out the old shoes that were thrown out of the window 30 years ago

20
00:00:49,780 --> 00:00:51,780
If the General Administration knows about this,

21
00:00:51,780 --> 00:00:52,780
We have to be sued for abusing national resources.
